      "side": 1,
      "message": "afaik, double_loadable is checked against \"core\" variants since we search the dep-graph from the LLNDK impl(which is core variant) as root.\nFor example, if we have a libfoo which is double_loadable/vendor_available but it can have a different set of shared_libs per variants.\n\n  cc_library {\n    libfoo, double_loadable, vendor_available,\n    shared_libs: [libbar],\n    vendor: { exclude_shared_libs: [ libbar ], }\n  }\n\nWe need to check libbar, but this condition prevents the search to the core variant of libbar.",
